usage: run_current_433_refresh_1060.py [-h] {bind,execute,preflight} ...

Bind the fresh mass-fit source receipt, then execute the pinned 433 refresh
owners. The command writes source-only artifacts. It does not run the native
solver or mass allocation. Every heavy owner is called once through
run_geometry_serial.py.

positional arguments:
  {bind,execute,preflight}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
